What I Learned
Importance of same-AZ routing when using dual NAT Gateways
Trade-offs between single NAT (cheaper) vs dual NAT (resilient)
Clean separation of public and private route tables
Using Terraform for repeatable infrastructure


Tech Stack
Infrastructure as Code: Terraform
Cloud: AWS (eu-north-1)
Services: VPC, Subnets, Internet Gateway, NAT Gateway, Elastic IP, Route Tables
